%% D. Adaptive question-selection workflow (Stage 1)
flowchart TB
  START["Answer received (typed or free text)"] --> ISFREE{"Free text?"}
  ISFREE -->|yes| PARSE["LLM #1 parse → facts (schema, key whitelist)"]
  ISFREE -->|no| TYPED["Typed value → FinancialFact"]
  PARSE --> OK{"Schema valid and keys registered?"}
  OK -->|no, retry once then| WIDGET["Fallback: typed widget for the same question"]
  OK -->|yes| LEDGER["Append facts (supersede on change, status stated/estimated)"]
  TYPED --> LEDGER
  LEDGER --> PROF["Materialize profile; run constraint rules C01–C07"]
  PROF --> CONF{"Conflicts?"}
  CONF -->|yes| CLAR["Emit clarification question (never overwrite silently)"]
  CLAR --> START
  CONF -->|no| CAND["Candidate set: missing/estimated facts with a path to a reachable metric"]
  CAND --> SENS["For each candidate: partial compute at low/high bounds → sensitivity"]
  SENS --> SCORE["score = req + w·sens − effort − privacy (config)"]
  SCORE --> STOP{"T0 complete and max sens < τ?"}
  STOP -->|yes| OFFER["Return null → UI offers Run analysis + optional questions with sens values"]
  STOP -->|no| PICK["Select argmax; generate text + why_we_ask from dependency path"]
  PICK --> LOG["question_log: score_breakdown"]
  LOG --> ASK["Ask (skip / estimate allowed)"]
  ASK --> START
